// std/jsx/attrs/controls: attribute types of form controls besides `<input>` and `<button>`
// (each is `HtmlAttrs`, the global attributes from attrs/global.vlt, `&` its own; public as
// `velt:jsx/attrs`).

import type { HtmlAttrs } from "velt:jsx/attrs/global";

// `<label>`.
export type LabelAttrs = HtmlAttrs & {
  for?: string;
};

// `<meter>`.
export type MeterAttrs = HtmlAttrs & {
  value?: string | i64 | f64;
  min?: string | i64 | f64;
  max?: string | i64 | f64;
  low?: string | i64 | f64;
  high?: string | i64 | f64;
  optimum?: string | i64 | f64;
};

// `<optgroup>`.
export type OptgroupAttrs = HtmlAttrs & {
  disabled?: bool;
  label?: string;
};

// `<option>`.
export type OptionAttrs = HtmlAttrs & {
  disabled?: bool;
  label?: string;
  selected?: bool;
  value?: string | i64 | f64;
};

// `<output>`.
export type OutputAttrs = HtmlAttrs & {
  for?: string;
  form?: string;
  name?: string;
};

// `<progress>`.
export type ProgressAttrs = HtmlAttrs & {
  value?: string | i64 | f64;
  max?: string | i64 | f64;
};

// `<select>`.
export type SelectAttrs = HtmlAttrs & {
  autocomplete?: string;
  disabled?: bool;
  form?: string;
  multiple?: bool;
  name?: string;
  required?: bool;
  size?: string | i64 | f64;
};

// `<textarea>` (its text is its children).
export type TextareaAttrs = HtmlAttrs & {
  autocomplete?: string;
  cols?: string | i64 | f64;
  dirname?: string;
  disabled?: bool;
  form?: string;
  maxlength?: string | i64 | f64;
  minlength?: string | i64 | f64;
  name?: string;
  placeholder?: string;
  readonly?: bool;
  required?: bool;
  rows?: string | i64 | f64;
  wrap?: string;
};
